  // checkouts could each pass eligibility and each collect a free month from one
  // eligibility. The reserve's INSERT contends on the same two unique constraints as
  // the grant, so exactly one checkout holds it; a loser re-quotes at FULL price so
  // its stamped total, card leg and settlement all agree (displayed === charged). The
  // hold is CONFIRMED at fulfilment, RELEASED on `checkout.session.expired`, and
  // swept as a backstop — an abandoned checkout never permanently burns the offer.
